{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismiss"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","role":"symbol","title":"dismiss","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV7dismissAA13DismissActionVvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismiss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismiss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this environment value to get the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the current "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to perform the dismissal. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method that Swift calls when you call the instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can create a button that calls the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct SheetContents: View {","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Done\") {","            dismiss()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you present the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SheetContents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view in a sheet, the user can dismiss","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sheet by tapping or clicking the sheet’s button:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            SheetContents()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Be sure that you define the action in the appropriate environment."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, don’t reorganize the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DetailView"},{"type":"text","text":" in the example above"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that it creates the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" property and calls it from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/sheet(item:onDismiss:content:)"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss \/\/ Applies to DetailView.","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            Button(\"Done\") {","                dismiss() \/\/ Fails to dismiss the sheet.","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you do this, the sheet fails to dismiss because the action applies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the environment where you declared it, which is that of the detail","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view, rather than the sheet. In fact, if you’ve presented the detail","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationView"},{"text":", the dismissal pops the detail view","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the navigation stack.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The dismiss action has no effect on a view that isn’t currently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presented. If you need to query whether OpenSwiftUI is currently presenting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a view, read the ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnvironmentValues\/isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" environment value.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss"},"abstract":[{"text":"An action that dismisses the current presentation.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Environment":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Environment","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environment","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","abstract":[{"text":"A property wrapper that reads a value from a view’s environment.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentValues"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues"},{"text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declare a property using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"text":" property wrapper and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specify the value’s key path. For example, you can read the current locale:","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues","title":"EnvironmentValues","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentValues"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"OpenSwiftUI"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissAction/callAsFunction()":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction\/callasfunction()","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"callAsFunction()","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"callAsFunction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Dismisses the view if it is currently presented."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismiss":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismiss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV"}],"title":"dismiss","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that dismisses the current presentation."}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismiss"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissAction":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","title":"DismissAction","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that dismisses a presentation."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissAction"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissAction"}]}}}